edureInstances, with separate one-variable and independence-dependent variance rules in one non-duplicated model contract\n- preserves S21/62 Q2(b) as exact Poisson-family candidates and records the exact S23/62 Q5(b)(ii) theory/practical dependence rationale\n- reuses authenticated P5 normal-probability, inverse-quantile, probability-tree, and discrete-variance models plus the P6-01 Poisson-moments model without cloning\n- publishes the immutable P6-02 delta, visual ledger, predecessor receipt, compact readback, and cumulative v2 projection/manifest\n\n## Release readback\n\n- denominator: 286 Questions / 920 QuestionParts (PASS)\n- family statuses: 55 approved, 2 candidate, 4 rejected, 22 abstain\n- ordered instances: 115; reused-model instances: 48\n- direct review: 39/39 QP chains and 39/39 MS chains; 132 image paths / 122 unique raw identities\n- predecessor raw authentication: 6 artifacts total, including 2 pre-materialization active artifacts\n- hard gates: all zero\n- deterministic rebuild: PASS; cache build/hit/miss = 1/1/1; harness raw authentication count = 2\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1800_p6_linear_combinations_semantic_kg.test.py` (10/10 PASS)\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1766_future_semantic_kg_producer.test.py` (30/30 PASS)\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1767_future_semantic_kg_harness.test.py` (27/27 PASS)\n- two consecutive full producer replays produced byte-identical receipt, ledger, readback, delta, projection, and manifest\n- immutable P6-01/P5 predecessor artifacts have no diff from the bound base\n- `git diff --check` (PASS)\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` (healthy checks; expected dirty-worktree warning before commit)\n\n## Notes\n\nThe future producer requires one central provider-admission registration line; all family semantics remain configuration/data-driven. The bounded generic-test authority allowlist now includes the four immutable P6-02 outputs. No immutable P6-01 artifact bytes changed and no remote data writes were performed.","created_at":"2026-07-31T10:57:39Z","updated_at":"2026-07-31T12:11:02Z","closed_at":"2026-07-31T11:32:50Z","merged_at":"2026-07-31T11:32:50Z","merge_commit_sha":"8157cba657374a73e4148b163d49dcfdae93afc0","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1807/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1807/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1807/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/c16a48b3a088b52540c7af9d6ff8a1944f24c964","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1800-p6-02-linear-combinations","ref":"task/1800-p6-02-linear-combinations","sha":"c16a48b3a088b52540c7af9d6ff8a1944f24c964","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":99